 * Money maths is identical to lib/actions-disk.ts expandServerDisk (proration ×
 * remaining term, then lib/wallet-split.ts), so what is shown here is what gets
 * charged; the server recomputes it authoritatively before taking a cent.
 *
 * GROWTH IS ONE-WAY — stated on the card, in the confirm dialog and in the
 * button copy. There is no shrink control because there is no shrink path.
